<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1914</h1><p class="ref-lede">1914 in world history: 51 events, 17 births, 15 deaths, 3 works, 7 states founded and 10 that came to an end. 749 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
